# IH-05: tests/integration/autonomous-{controlled-pilot,run-dogfood-pilot}
# write generated evidence into docs/engineering/ as a side effect of a
# full suite run. Those artifacts were never tracked, but they were also
# never ignored, so every local `pnpm test` left the working tree dirty --
# a recurring trap for the "clean tree at Work Unit boundaries" rule.
# Ignoring the generated artifacts is the fix; the suites' behavior is
# unchanged.
docs/engineering/*.generated.json
